        <mxCell id="s3-desc" value="Signal returns. The queue drains in arrival order. Each record carries its idempotency key, so the same job is never written twice. If a server-side conflict is detected (e.g. rate-card version changed), it is surfaced to the user — never resolved silently." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A365D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
